 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch43_06_03\" class=\" \"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp18656800\" data-alt=\"Illustration shows a fish dissected by lines into anterior (front) and posterior (rear) ends and dorsal (top) and ventral (bottom) surfaces.\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/f477cd04d0d32dd41d4109694a6717e6bce0b04c\" data-media-type=\"image/jpg\" alt=\"Illustration shows a fish dissected by lines into anterior (front) and posterior (rear) ends and dorsal (top) and ventral (bottom) surfaces.\" width=\"575\" height=\"266\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
